   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida, through the HIV/AIDS Team for Africa, supported IDASA&apos;s Governance and AIDS Programme to convene a Regional HIV/AIDS and GOvernance Forum in collaboration with UNDP. The Forum took place in Cape Town in April 2003 and is documented in the book &quot;AIDS and Governance in Southern Africa: Emerging Theories and Perspectives&quot;. Two CD-ROMs have also been produced.</narrative>
